{"pin":"BH00015","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00015","anchor":"","title":"Lawh-i-Istintaq (Tablet of the Interrogation)","first_line":"Glorified art Thou, O Thou through Whom the Essence is realized within the Essence, and the Ancient Being is adorned with the mantle of Names [3.5s]... ...My name is Bahá’u’lláh (Light of God), and My country is Núr (Light). Be ye apprized of it.","first_line_orig":"سبحانک یا من بک حقق الذات فی الذات و تردی کینونة القدم برداء الاسماء... این عبد تا ان یوم از لسان عظمت ایات قهریه باین شان استماع ننموده  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"9560","notes":" \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#128\"\u003eLL#128\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#587","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"587","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/195383813"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS4.220-260","source":"MAS4","locator":"220-260","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MAS4/mas4-220.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MUH3.384-385x","source":"MUH3","locator":"384-385x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/286.pdf#page=400"},{"kind":"publication","code":"OOL.B168","source":"OOL","locator":"B168","url":"https://oceanoflights.org/bahaullah-st-168-fa"},{"kind":"publication","code":"QT108.128-130x","source":"QT108","locator":"128-130x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/356.pdf#page=128"},{"kind":"publication","code":"RHQM2.0746x (141-154) (090x)","source":"RHQM2","locator":"0746x (141-154) (090x)","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/653.pdf#page=67"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BTO#15","source":"BTO","locator":"15","url":"https://bahaiteachings.org/bahai-prayer-islam/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"GPB.190x","source":"GPB","locator":"190x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/852681921"}]},{"code":"BH00015REA","anchor":"rea","translations":[{"language":"id","lang_name":"Indonesian"}]}]}
